flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Enter number of students/]
    B --> C[Create empty records list]
    C --> D[/Enter roll number, name, and marks/]
    D --> E[Store details as a tuple]
    E --> F[Add tuple to records list]
    F --> G{More students?}
    G -- Yes --> D
    G -- No --> H[Traverse records list]
    H --> I[/Display each student record/]
    I --> J([Stop])
